{"repo": {"timestamp": 1789347770000, "version": 20002, "name": "Sovereign Edge", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://frenchtoastbig7-ux.github.io/fdroid/repo", "description": "Pocket Agent, a private on-device Claude agent for GrapheneOS, published by Sovereign Edge Inc."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"antiFeatures": ["NonFreeNet"], "authorName": "Sovereign Edge Inc.", "categories": ["AI Chat"], "suggestedVersionCode": "2", "description": "Pocket Agent is a personal assistant that runs on your phone and uses Claude as its model. It is built for GrapheneOS and talks to exactly one server: Anthropic's API.\n\nWhat it can do, with your permission:\n* Read and send SMS, look up contacts, read and add calendar events, read the call log and recent notifications\n* Read and write files in a private workspace folder\n* Search and read the web\n* Read the screen and tap, type and scroll in other apps (accessibility service)\n* Remember you across chats (MEMORY.md / USER.md), write reusable skills, and search past chats\n* Run scheduled automations that report back in a private notification\n* Split research into parallel read-only sub-agents\n\nAnything that sends, taps, types or changes data is shown to you for approval first. Scheduled runs are read-only. The API key is encrypted with the Android Keystore. There are no analytics and no Google Play Services.\n\nYou need your own Anthropic API key.", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0", "name": "Pocket Agent", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent", "summary": "Private on-device Claude agent with memory, skills and automations", "added": 1789344199000, "packageName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketagent", "lastUpdated": 1789347770000}], "packages": {"com.sovereignedge.pocketagent": [{"added": 1789347770000, "apkName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketagent_2.apk", "hash": "56d48eca9d31d62dc61100fe936f4d211076d23058